BOPAlgo: the stick vertices of a pair of intersected faces
(BOPAlgo_PaveFiller::GetStickVertices, the vertices of the VV, VE, EE, VF
and EF interferences between the two faces' sub-shapes) were found by going
through every such interference of the operation for every pair of faces,
in MakeBlocks and again in PostTreatFF: quadratic in the interferences of a
union of many bodies. On the union of a machine's 257 bodies (mitcad#1279)
it took about 1.4 s of the union's single-threaded part. The interferences
are now listed by the shapes they join (an index made once, and made again
when interferences have been added since), and those of a pair
are found from the sub-shapes of its two faces; their vertices are added in
the order the scan added them (by kind, then by index), so the maps filled
are the same. GetStickVertices itself is unchanged. The results are
unchanged.
